# Isshin, Two Heavens as One: "If a creature attacking causes a triggered ability of a permanent you control to trigger,
# that ability triggers an additional time" (CR 603.2d). Hero of Bladehold attacks: its battle cry and its "create two
# 1/1 Soldier tokens that are tapped and attacking" each trigger twice - four triggers, each its own. Bot1 puts the two
# battle cries on the stack first, so both token abilities resolve first: four Soldiers, then two battle cries, each
# giving every other attacking creature +1/+0. Each Soldier is 3/1, the Hero 3/4: 3 + 4 x 3 = 15 damage.
# Turn 1: Isshin (Mox Ruby, Plains, Mox Jet). Turn 3: the Hero (Black Lotus for WWW and the Plains). Turn 5: the attack.

